SECTION: FOOTER (The Deja Vu)

Vibe: Pure, uncompromising UI. A hard snap back to reality.
Goal: Prove you can build chaotic, beautiful physics, but also know exactly
how to clean up your DOM and deliver pristine accessibility.

THE CONTAINER & ARCHITECTURE

The Transition (The Hard Snap):

Mechanism: A scroll-triggered state interrupt (e.g., Intersection Observer).

Action: The exact moment the user scrolls past the top boundary, unmount
or explicitly hide the WebGL Canvas context from the Water/Earth sections.
NO fade-outs, NO smooth easing. It must be an instant, jarring cut.

Background Color: #0F172A (Deep matte slate, identical to the Hero section).

Top Border: A crisp, 1px solid line using #1E293B (Light Slate) to separate
it from the pitch-black cave above.

Layout Structure: A rigid, max-width flexbox or CSS Grid container,
perfectly center-aligned.

THE INTERRUPT PROMPT (Top Boundary Element)

Text: > system.override(tototofu); // take off headset

Placement: Positioned at the very top of the footer, acting as the physical
threshold the user crosses.

Typography: Space Grotesk (geometric UI font, replacing standard code fonts).

Color: #94A3B8 (Cool Gray).

Interaction: Optionally acts as a clickable button that instantly scrolls
the user back to the top Hero section, resetting the entire journey.

THE NAVIGATION GRID (Main Elements)

Layout: A 4-column CSS Grid.

[ Column Headers ]

Text: "DEVELOPMENT", "DESIGN", "CONNECT", "STATUS"

Typography: Space Grotesk, Weight: 600 (Bold), Uppercase, slightly expanded tracking.

Color: #F8FAFC (High-contrast Off-white).

[ Grid Links ]

Typography: DM Sans (Clean body font for high readability).

Color: #94A3B8 (Cool Gray).

Hover State: Instant color swap to #F8FAFC (Off-white). No slow CSS transitions.

Column 1 (Development):

GitHub Repository

Tech Blog (blog.lai.codes)

Column 2 (Design):

Figma Source

Framer Prototypes

Column 3 (Connect):

LinkedIn

Github (Profile)

Column 4 (Status/Exploration):

More about Me (explore) -> Coming Soon

THE SIGN-OFF (Bottom Boundary Element)

Layout: Full-width flex container spreading items between left and right edges.

Left Text: © 2026 Toto Lai Man To. All systems operational.

Right Text: The t.tofu logo mark, rendered as a simple, flat, single-color
SVG (using #1E293B).

Typography: DM Sans, Size: 12px or 14px.

Color: #64748B (Darker slate gray so it fades into the background hierarchy).

TECHNICAL UX NOTE

Because this footer relies on the "Snap to Reality" effect, you MUST ensure
that there are absolutely NO lingering CSS animations, floating particles,
or requestAnimationFrame loops running in the background when this section
is visible.